Class references whose address is taken folded into the GOT as Xcode 27.0's ld folds them (B-193, docs/formats/build.md
"Objective-C references, archive members and hints in the linked image"): from iOS 18 an adrp and add of a class
reference become an adrp and add of the class's GOT slot, given one even for a class of the image, and a function
doing so keeps its other uses of that reference on the slot; loads of a class of the image elsewhere stay adrp and add
of the class. 0014 folded only loads, so Swift's adrp and add of class references kept __objc_classrefs (swiftfin).
